      "text": "[7:30PM] #Masha_Aguda #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic movement from Eric Moore inward to Bode Thomas Junction.\nUnimpeded traffic flow along Babs Animashaun, with good movement observed inward and outward at Census/Doyin.\nGood traffic conditions from Census inward Aiyetoro, down to Brown, with signalized traffic light management at NEPA.\nOptimal traffic movement from Aguda to Pako, extending to Ijesha Market.\nFluid traffic flow from Otun Oba to Lawanson/Ogunlana, down to Ojuelegba.\nUnencumbered traffic movement from Census to Agboyin/Adelabu, extending to Kilo, down to Nnobi.\nGood traffic conditions from Onilegogoro to Masha, with a similarly smooth return journey.\nSmooth traffic movement from Ogunlana to Cele Okota Link Bridge, inward to Cele Service Lane, with Oshodi Expressway also experiencing good traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
