      "text": "[7:44PM] #OpebiAllen #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic movement from Aromire inward Adeniyi Johns, with a similarly unimpeded return journey to Allen Intersection.\nOptimal traffic flow at Allen Intersection, facilitated by a functional and perfectly working solar traffic signal light, with personnel actively monitoring the traffic.\nGood traffic conditions from Allen Intersection inward Ikeja, although a minor delay is observed when approaching the underpass bridge in Ikeja. The return journey from Ikeja back to Allen Intersection is notably smooth.\nFree-flowing traffic from Allen Intersection inward Radio Junction, with an equally unencumbered return journey back to Allen Intersection.\nImproved traffic conditions at Adebola House, with a smooth traffic flow observed from Salvation to Sharaton Link Bridge and back to Adebola House.\nUnimpeded traffic movement on Opebi Link Bridge, Toyin Street stretch, and Ikosi Junction, which has shown improvement.\nGood traffic flow from Welfare Junction down to Olusosu, Ojota.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
