      "text": "[8:40PM] #Dopemu #TrafficUpdate \n\nCongested traffic movement from Cement to Iyana Ipaja, with the return journey from Goye Junction to Akiwojo Junction, and further down to Alaguntan Junction, also experiencing slow traffic conditions.\nSmooth traffic flow from Agbotikuyo to Swipha, extending to Akowonjo Roundabout and connecting to Shasha Traffic Light.\nUnimpeded traffic movement from Vulcanizer Bus Stop to Ogunlana Junction, Egbeda.\n\nOfficers are strategically on ground to manage the traffic effectively, and no impediments have been reported at the moment.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
